<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Placer raises Porgera reserves 11 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Placer raises Porgera reserves 11 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Placer Dome Inc, operator of the Porgera gold mine in Papua New Guinea, said on Tuesday it had increased reserves at the mine by about 11 percent to 11.6 million ounces.</p>
</text>
